\newlabel{fig:worldlines}{{5}{5}{Deformation of worldline family $\Gamma $ under the warp operator $D$. Worldlines $\gamma _i$ at $t=10$ are shown passing through the warp envelope $\mathcal {E}(D)$ (blue surface). The warp operator produces coherent curvature without intersections, demonstrating guided deformation}{figure.5}{}}
